# MeshForge fleet host list — one host per line.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Format: [user@]hostname
# Uses ~/.ssh/config for aliases, jump hosts, identity files.
#
# Copy to:
#   ~/.config/meshforge/fleet_hosts
#
# Then run:
#   scripts/fleet_sync.sh

# volcanoai       # fleet manager — include only if /opt/meshforge is deployed there
# volcano         # access hop — include only if it runs the gateway itself
# moc
# moc1
# moc2
# DO NOT include the local host (this Pi) — it would pull over SSH back to itself
